# Runtime material-array manifest.
# Keep the first 16 entries in this order so authored .s3dlevel files remain compatible.
# Format: material name albedo normal specular smoothness [rod_mask]
# Auto maps use the explicit surface identities in game.finishes. Existing albedo artwork is preserved.
# Set an individual map path again to use an authored replacement.
